---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Sett Agency"
  description="How Sett Agency collects and uses information through settagency.com."
>
  <main class="doc-main">
    <div class="doc-inner">

      <h1 class="doc-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="doc-meta">Last updated: 18 June 2026</p>

      <p>Sett Agency ("Sett", "we", "us") is a branding and web design studio based in Sarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina. This policy explains what information we collect through settagency.com and how we use it.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand how visitors use our website. This may include your approximate location, device type, browser, pages visited, and how you arrived at the site. Google Analytics uses cookies to collect this information.</p>
      <p>We do not currently collect information through contact forms, newsletters, or account registration. If you reach out to us directly by email or phone, we hold onto that correspondence only to respond to you and manage our working relationship, if one begins.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>Analytics data helps us understand which parts of our website work and where we should improve. We do not sell or share this data with third parties beyond Google's own processing as our analytics provider.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Our website uses cookies set by Google Analytics. You can disable cookies through your browser settings at any time. Doing so will not affect your ability to browse the site, only our ability to see anonymised usage data.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>If you are located in the UK or EU, you have rights under data protection law, including the right to know what data is held about you and to request it be deleted. To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@settagency.com">hello@settagency.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics is our only third-party data processor. You can read Google's own privacy policy at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy as our website and services evolve. Any changes will be posted on this page.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:hello@settagency.com">hello@settagency.com</a></p>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .doc-main {
    background: #F7F6F2;
    padding: clamp(80px, 12vw, 140px) clamp(24px, 6vw, 80px) clamp(80px, 10vw, 120px);
  }

  .doc-inner {
    max-width: 740px;
  }

  .doc-title {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: #111111;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .doc-meta {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #888888;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .doc-inner p {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #555555;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .doc-inner h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #111111;
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .doc-inner a {
    color: #111111;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: #BBBBBB;
    text-decoration-thickness: 0.5px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .doc-inner a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: #111111;
  }
</style>
